<title>USA: Evergreen Media offers preferred shares.</title>
<headline>Evergreen Media offers preferred shares.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evergreen Media Corp said on Wednesday that it had increased the size of a private placement of preferred stock from 4 million to 5.5 million shares due to demand for the issue.</p>
<p>The placement, expected to generate up to $275 million in proceeds, will be used in part to finance the company's purchase of 10 radio stations from Viacom Internatinal Inc, a unit of Viacom Inc, the company said.</p>
<p>In addition, Evergreen said it had granted an over-allotment option to purchase up to an additional 500,000 shares.</p>
